#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:271
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DeviceForTalkingToPokemon"
msgid ""
"We're developing a device for talking\n"
"with POKéMON.\p"
"But we haven't had much success…$"
msgstr ""
"我们正在开发\n"
"能和宝可梦对话的装置。\p"
"可是一直没什么进展……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:276
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DevelopingNewBalls"
msgid ""
"I'm developing new kinds of\n"
"POKé BALLS…\p"
"But I haven't made much headway…$"
msgstr ""
"我正在开发新型的精灵球……\p"
"可是一直没什么进展……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:281
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_WeFinallyMadeNewBalls"
msgid ""
"We finally made new kinds of\n"
"POKé BALLS!\p"
"The REPEAT BALL makes it easier to\n"
"catch POKéMON you've caught before.\p"
"The TIMER BALL gets better at catching\n"
"POKéMON the longer a battle runs.\p"
"Both are proudly developed by\n"
"the DEVON CORPORATION.\p"
"Please give them a try!$"
msgstr ""
"我们终于做出新型的精灵球了！\p"
"重复球更容易捉到\n"
"以前捉到过的宝可梦。\p"
"计时球在对战持续得越久时，\n"
"就越容易捉到宝可梦。\p"
"这两种都是得文公司\n"
"引以为傲的产品。\p"
"请一定要试试看！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:292
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_IMadePokenav"
msgid ""
"I made the POKéNAV!\p"
"As an engineer, I feel blessed to have\n"
"made something so great!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可导航是我做的！\p"
"作为一名工程师，能做出这么棒的\n"
"东西，我感到非常幸福！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:297
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_WowThatsAPokenav"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow!\n"
"That's a POKéNAV!\p"
"It came about as a result of our\n"
"PRESIDENT's desire to learn about\l"
"the feelings of POKéMON.\p"
"Would you like me to describe its\n"
"features in detail?\p"
"No, no. I think you'll find out just by\n"
"trying the POKéNAV out.$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"那是宝可导航！\p"
"它的诞生，是因为我们社长\n"
"想要了解宝可梦的心情。\p"
"要我详细介绍一下\n"
"它的功能吗？\p"
"不不，我想你只要用一用\n"
"宝可导航，自然就会明白了。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DeviceToVisualizePokemonDreams"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to develop a device that\n"
"visually reproduces the dreams of\l"
"POKéMON…\p"
"But it's not going well.$"
msgstr ""
"我正在开发一种能把宝可梦的梦\n"
"用影像重现出来的装置……\p"
"可是进行得不太顺利。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DevelopDeviceToResurrectFossils"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to develop a device\n"
"that resurrects POKéMON from fossils…\p"
"And, it's working!$"
msgstr ""
"我一直在开发一种\n"
"能让宝可梦从化石中复活的装置……\p"
"而且，成功了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:319
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_WantToBringFossilBackToLife"
msgid ""
"Wait! That thing you have there…\n"
"Is that a POKéMON fossil?\p"
"Would you like to bring that POKéMON\n"
"back to life?\p"
"I can with my newly developed\n"
"FOSSIL REGENERATOR.$"
msgstr ""
"等一下！你拿着的那个……\n"
"是宝可梦的化石吗？\p"
"你想让那只宝可梦\n"
"复活吗？\p"
"用我新开发的化石复原机\n"
"就能做到哦。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_OhIsThatSo"
msgid ""
"Oh, is that so?\p"
"DEVON's technological expertise\n"
"is outstanding, I tell you.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是吗？\p"
"我跟你说，得文公司的技术\n"
"可是非常出色的。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:332
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_TwoFossilsPickOne"
msgid ""
"Oh, now that's a surprise!\n"
"You have not one, but two, fossils?\p"
"Unfortunately, my machine can only\n"
"regenerate one POKéMON at a time.\p"
"Would you like to pick one of your\n"
"fossils for regeneration?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这可真让人吃惊！\n"
"你竟然有2块化石？\p"
"可惜我的机器一次\n"
"只能复原1只宝可梦。\p"
"你要从你的化石里\n"
"选1块来复原吗？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_HandedFossilToResearcher"
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"Let's do this right away.\p"
"{PLAYER} handed the {STR_VAR_1} to\n"
"the DEVON RESEARCHER.$"
msgstr ""
"太好了！\n"
"我们马上开始吧。\p"
"{PLAYER}把{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"交给了得文公司的研究员。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_FossilRegeneratorTakesTime"
msgid ""
"The FOSSIL REGENERATOR, which I made,\n"
"is incredible.\p"
"But it has one drawback--it takes\n"
"a long time to work.\p"
"So, uh… How about you go for a stroll\n"
"and look around for a while?$"
msgstr ""
"我做的化石复原机\n"
"真的很了不起。\p"
"但它有一个缺点——\n"
"就是需要花很长的时间。\p"
"所以，呃……你要不要先去\n"
"散散步，到处逛一逛？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_FossilizedMonBroughtBackToLife"
msgid ""
"Thanks for waiting!\p"
"Your fossilized POKéMON has been\n"
"brought back to life!\p"
"The fossil was an ancient POKéMON.\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, it was!$"
msgstr ""
"让你久等了！\p"
"你的化石宝可梦\n"
"已经复活了！\p"
"那块化石是一只古代宝可梦。\n"
"原来是{STR_VAR_2}啊！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:361
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_ReceivedMonFromResearcher"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received {STR_VAR_2} from\n"
"the DEVON RESEARCHER.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从得文公司的研究员那里\n"
"得到了{STR_VAR_2}。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_TooManyPokemon"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, you've got too many POKéMON.\n"
"You have no room for this one.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的宝可梦太多了。\n"
"已经没有空位放这只了。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:370
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DevelopNewPokenavFeature"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to develop a new feature\n"
"for the POKéNAV…\p"
"But it's not going well.$"
msgstr ""
"我正在为宝可导航\n"
"开发新功能……\p"
"可是进行得不太顺利。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_WhatToWorkOnNext"
msgid ""
"Well, now what shall I work on\n"
"developing next?\p"
"Our company allows us to make our\n"
"inspirations into reality.\p"
"One couldn't ask for a better\n"
"environment as an engineer.$"
msgstr ""
"好了，接下来要开发\n"
"什么好呢？\p"
"我们公司能让我们\n"
"把灵感变成现实。\p"
"对工程师来说，\n"
"没有比这更好的环境了。$"
